        "title": "Baltic neopaganism",
        "raw_score": 8.14913373892043,
        "source": "kg"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Wilhelm Storost, artistic name Vilius Storostas-Vydūnas (22 March 1868 – 20 February 1953), mostly known as Vydūnas, was a Prussian-Lithuanian teacher, poet, humanist, philosopher and Lithuanian",
