    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Samfälligheten för Nordisk Sed is a Swedish religious organisation adhering to Germanic Neopaganism. It is one of the proponents of the \"Folktro\" approach to Germanic Neopaganism. Begun in 1996 as \"a network of independent kindreds\", it was formally founded in 1997. In 2000 Samfälligheten was one of the first religious organisations registered as a \"registrerat trossamfund\" due to the new Swedish laws, and \"is now modeled on the former state church.\"",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.33185946190266674,
